Memory Map
© 2026 Sumin Kim

A 3D web piece for walking through the memories of Bogwang-dong's alleys
and Gwangju Theater. Concept, code, design, and the Bogwang-dong documentary
photos and video are by Sumin Kim.

Feel free to look around and leave a memory.
If you'd like to reuse or share any part of this work, please get in touch first:
0202sally@gmail.com

Built with
- Three.js (MIT License)
- Bricktown 3D assets by loafbrr
- Gwangju Theater 3D asset, Unity Asset Store
